00||BCD 5 bytes frequency (10 Hz/1 Hz byte first)|Send operating frequency (transceive)|Data format p.20-11; unsolicited transceive output
01||mode byte + filter byte (see 06)|Send operating mode (transceive)|p.20-11; filter byte may be omitted
02||none (read) -> 2x BCD 5 bytes with separator 2D|Read band edge frequencies|p.20-12
03||BCD 5 bytes frequency|Read operating frequency|p.20-11
04||mode byte + filter byte|Read operating mode|00 LSB 01 USB 02 AM 03 CW 04 RTTY 05 FM 06 WFM 07 CW-R 08 RTTY-R 17 DV; filter 01 FIL1 02 FIL2 03 FIL3; p.20-11
05||BCD 5 bytes frequency|Set operating frequency|p.20-11
06|00|optional filter byte 01~03|Select LSB mode|cmd 06 carries mode byte (+ optional filter byte FIL1-3); manual lists each mode as sub cmd
06|01|optional filter byte 01~03|Select USB mode|
06|02|optional filter byte 01~03|Select AM mode|
06|03|optional filter byte 01~03|Select CW mode|
06|04|optional filter byte 01~03|Select RTTY mode|
06|05|optional filter byte 01~03|Select FM mode|
06|06|optional filter byte 01~03|Select WFM mode|FIL1 forced for WFM
06|07|optional filter byte 01~03|Select CW-R mode|
06|08|optional filter byte 01~03|Select RTTY-R mode|
06|17|optional filter byte 01~03|Select DV mode|
07||none|Select VFO mode|
07|00|none|Select VFO A|
07|01|none|Select VFO B|
07|A0|none|Equalize VFO A and VFO B|A=B
07|B0|none|Exchange VFO A and VFO B|swap
08||none|Select Memory mode|
08||BCD 2 bytes 0001~0109|Select memory channel|0001=M-CH01..0099=M-CH99 0100=1A 0101=1B 0102=2A 0103=2B 0104=3A 0105=3B 0106=144-C1 0107=144-C2 0108=430-C1 0109=430-C2
08|A0 01|none|Select Memory Bank A|A0 followed by 01..05
08|A0 02|none|Select Memory Bank B|
08|A0 03|none|Select Memory Bank C|
08|A0 04|none|Select Memory Bank D|
08|A0 05|none|Select Memory Bank E|
